{"4217440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Inner Peace", "steam_appid": 4217440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inner Peace is a physics sandbox game where you bounce balls around a world to direct them into a target. It's simple, releaxing and satisfying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rules: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balls</strong> are shoot out from a <strong>rocket</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You bounce the balls by placing <strong>bouncers</strong> around the map. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>secrets</strong>, <strong>energy rings</strong> and direct the balls to their <strong>targets</strong>. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features at Early Access Release: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 maps in different biomes: 6x in Green Village, preview maps in Pink Fields and Tall Woods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges 3 per map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upcomming Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different biomes, each with unique rules. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of balls, all with different physics properties. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many maps. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges and collectables. </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inner Peace is a physics sandbox game where you bounce balls around a world to direct them into a target. It's simple, releaxing and satisfying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rules: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balls</strong> are shoot out from a <strong>rocket</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You bounce the balls by placing <strong>bouncers</strong> around the map. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>secrets</strong>, <strong>energy rings</strong> and direct the balls to their <strong>targets</strong>. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features at Early Access Release: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 maps in different biomes: 6x in Green Village, preview maps in Pink Fields and Tall Woods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges 3 per map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upcomming Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different biomes, each with unique rules. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of balls, all with different physics properties. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many maps. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges and collectables. </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Inner Peace is a physics sandbox game where you bounce balls around a world to direct them into a target. Simple, releaxing and satisfying. ", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217440/5b1937111cb1953ee2e41af0ed5a94ccfe276e11/header.jpg?t=1767984304", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217440/8ff9f4d850136b4eb1bd733a8fc78b6e54c5c3c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767984304", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217440/8ff9f4d850136b4eb1bd733a8fc78b6e54c5c3c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767984304", "website": "https://discord.com/invite/ea2KPrN2au", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><str